  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM Support till SNV_DAZ Integration ska implementeras 2021</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM Support to SNV_DAZ Integration to be implemented within 2021. - RBM Support to SNV_DAZ Integration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dairy Association of Zambia is a new partner with Sida and has not benefited from the training initiative on Results Based Management (RBM). Therefore the organisation has challenges in applying RBM in project implementation and reporting. The Embassy intends to strengthen the capacity of DAZ hence the decision to undertake RBM capacity building initiative. The activity will involve particularly revising the results framework, including assisting in identifying appropriate methods and routines for monitoring and evaluation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Dairy Association of Zambia &#xe4;r en ny partner med Sida och har inte dragit nytta av utbildningsinitiativet om Results Based Management (RBM). Organisationen utmaningar med att till&#xe4;mpa RBM i projektgenomf&#xf6;rande och rapportering och syftet med insatsen &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka DAZ:s kapacitet inom RBM-kapacitetsuppbyggnad. Insatsen kommer att bidra till en &#xf6;versyn av resultatramverket, inklusive att hj&#xe4;lpa till med att identifiera l&#xe4;mpliga metoder och rutiner f&#xf6;r uppf&#xf6;ljning och utv&#xe4;rdering.</narrative>
  </description>
